          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilanyor laainei, ore anaa eyieunoto naata naleng pee aigeroki intae mbaa naaipirta enjeunoto ang niking'ar, nadol ajo meeta nchere maigeroki intae, asai intae erishisho aamitu enkirukoto e Nkai naishooki apa nabo kata te lulung'ata lelo sinyat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etijing'aki atua intae te mpurrokinoto ilkulikae laa ninche apa etegelakaki endung'okinoto e nkiguana, iltung'ana lemeiruk Enkai ookur empiris e Nkai ang aaitaa enkoitoi naasie ntorrok nemiki ilo laa ninye ake olkitok lang, naa Olaitoriani lang Yesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
