              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neton ake eiko neijia kulo tung'ana too nkidetidetat enye neidurukie osesen, neany enkitoria, nemor iloata enkitoo le shumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.8",
