              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.1-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oi ninche! Amu etusujaitie orrekie le Kain netapalakita ate enkitapong'oroto e Balaam te nkaraki dupoto, nemuti ninche te nkiseroto e Kora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ninche naa iltipot ooiduruk ti atua isiruai linyi le nyorrata epeipeeno te nebo meeta osul negolie ate meeta isura. Inkatampo nemeeta enkare, naaya osiwuo, o lkeek lemeeta ilng'anayio te siadi ari ootuata katitin are, ootadotuoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilopir le naiposha ootarasutua ooitokitoku labur le nkurruna enye, lakir oopuaya laa ninche eitaanyitai emisimisi e naimin o lodo le nkop ntarasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
